{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-philips-pressurized-steam-generator-iron-2411-0072","content_id":"54e8c7e8-41da-48a8-8395-b1cd4ecc9ca3","description":"Product Recall for Philips Pressurized Steam Generator Iron presenting a medium risk of burns. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"bf36f2a0-1e62-4208-ba85-f0bb9f934a2f","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-18T10:37:52+00:00","id":"bf36f2a0-1e62-4208-ba85-f0bb9f934a2f","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:37:52+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6943d98036f089d38be1f2bf/2411-0072-2512-0206-product-recall-philips-pressurised-steam-iron.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Philips Pressurized Steam Generator Iron</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a medium risk of burns as the welding seam may fail.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Pressurized Steam Generator Iron</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Philips</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>starting with GC96 or PSG8</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Batch Numbers</td>\n      <td>2419, 2420, 2421, 2422, 2423, 2424, 2425, 2426, 2427, 2428, 2429, 2430, 2431, 2432, 2433, 2434, 2435, 2436, 2437, 2438, 2439, 2440, 2441</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Production Period</td>\n      <td>May 2024 - October 2024</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Indonesia</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>A steam iron with 2 component parts, an iron part and a steam generator available in several colours. You can find the product model number and code numbers under the appliance.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_bf36f2a0-1e62-4208-ba85-f0bb9f934a2f\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6943d98036f089d38be1f2bf/2411-0072-2512-0206-product-recall-philips-pressurised-steam-iron.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of burns to the user as it has been identified that the welding seam of the boiler can split open.</p>\n\n<p>The failure of the welding seam leads to the escape of hot steam which can burn the user.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users. We recommend that owners stop using the product immediately and unplug it from mains power supply.  </p>\n\n<p>A modification programme is underway for repairs and refunds. </p>\n\n<p>For further information and to register your product, access the Philips recall page at the following link:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.philips.co.uk/c-e/ho/recall-perfectcare-8000-9000-elite-series\">Recall - Philips</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD case number: 2411-0072, 2512-0206</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"Scope of recall expanded to include additional model numbers (now includes all models starting with GC96 or PSG8) and additional batch codes (now includes 2419, 2420, 2424, 2425, 2426, 2427, 2428, 2429, 2430, 2431, 2432, 2433, 2434, 2435, 2436, 2437, 2438, 2439, 2440, 2441 ). ","public_timestamp":"2025-12-18T10:38:50Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2024-11-21T17:33:36Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["modification-programme","recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2024-11-21","product_risk_level":"medium"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2024-11-21T17:33:36+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-philips-pressurized-steam-generator-iron-2411-0072","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-philips-pressurized-steam-generator-iron-2411-0072","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-philips-pressurized-steam-generator-iron-2411-0072","content_id":"54e8c7e8-41da-48a8-8395-b1cd4ecc9ca3","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-12-18T10:38:50Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: Philips Pressurized Steam Generator Iron (2411-0072)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-philips-pressurized-steam-generator-iron-2411-0072","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"